Error [E0380]: This loop needs a named source binding.
  --> tests/ui/loop_bindingless_named_bindings.jet:3:20
    |
  3 |     scalar :: loop n -> n * 2
    |                    ^
 Why: An implicit subject is one collection item; a scalar source or nested loop needs a distinct named binding.
 Fix: Write `loop item, source -> ...`; give nested loops named bindings.

Error [E0380]: This loop needs a named source binding.
  --> tests/ui/loop_bindingless_named_bindings.jet:6:34
    |
  6 |     nested :: loop words -> loop words -> .len()
    |                                  ^^^^^
 Why: An implicit subject is one collection item; a scalar source or nested loop needs a distinct named binding.
 Fix: Write `loop item, source -> ...`; give nested loops named bindings.
